+
+1. uc_over
+
+- Objective:
+  * Test MSR read logic of MCE handler
+  * Test synchronization between monarch and subject
+  * Test logic of uncorrected with UC and OVER
+- Code path tested:
+  * do_machine_check()
+  * mce_start()
+  * mce_timeout() except if (*t <= 0) branch
