+  * Test logic of uncorrected and corrected
+  * Test logic of uncorrected with UC and OVER
+  * Test logic of corrected with EXCP
+- Code path tested:
+  * do_machine_check()
+  * mce_start()
+  * mce_timeout() except if (*t <= 0) branch
+  * mce_log()
+  * mce_end()
+  * mce_severity()
+  * mce_reign() until mce_panic("Fatal Machine check",)
+  * mce_panic()
+  * print_mce()
+- Reference:
